@startuml Withdraw Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram
title Withdraw Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram

[*] --> Authenticated

Authenticated --> ViewHome: Navigate to VTS

ViewHome --> ViewBalance: Display request summary\nand balances

ViewBalance --> SelectRequest: Employee selects\npending request

SelectRequest --> PendingApproval: Request status:\nPending Approval

PendingApproval --> ConfirmWithdraw: VTS prompts for\nconfirmation

ConfirmWithdraw --> EmployeeConfirms: Employee confirms\nwithdraw request

EmployeeConfirms --> Withdrawn: Request removed from\nmanager's pending list

Withdrawn --> NotifyManager: Notification email\nsent to manager

NotifyManager --> UpdateState: Request state changed\nto withdrawn

UpdateState --> ViewHome: Return to home page

ViewHome --> [*]

note right of PendingApproval
  Precondition: Request must be
  pending approval from manager
end note

note right of Withdrawn
  Request is no longer in
  manager's approval queue
end note

note right of UpdateState
  System marks the request
  as withdrawn in database
end note

@enduml
